  id: 4
  displayName: Appeal to nature
  type: TwistedEvidence
  text: Why use harsh chemicals when you can use this 100% natural, plant-based ingredient?
    Nature always knows best.
  debunkingText: This is the Appeal to Nature fallacy. "Natural" does not automatically
    mean "safe" or "better." Cyanide, arsenic, and snake venom are all 100% natural.
  level: 1
